          "id": "zib-compost",
          "title": "Zib's Compost Pile",
          "text": "Dear friend, I made a compost pile in my garden. I put in carrot peels and lettuce leaves. Worms help the scraps rot. Now I have rich soil, and my vegetables grow big! Your friend, Zib",
